title: "Componentes backend/frontend — Médicos, especialidades y disponibilidad"
---
flowchart LR
  subgraph FE[Frontend Vue 3]
    pages[DoctorsPage.vue · DoctorForm.vue<br/>SpecialtyLinkForm.vue · AvailabilityPage.vue] --> store[stores/doctors.js<br/>Pinia]
    store --> api[api/doctorsApi.js<br/>plugins/axios + X-Tenant-ID + JWT]
  end
  subgraph BE[Backend Laravel 12]
    mw[Middlewares<br/>tenant · jwt.auth · permission:medicos.*] --> ctrl[Api/V1/DoctorController<br/>+ FormRequests]
    ctrl --> app[Application<br/>RegisterDoctor · AssociateSpecialty · QueryAvailability]
    app --> dom[Domain<br/>Period · SpecialtyAssignmentPolicy · SlotPlanner]
    app --> port{{DoctorRepository · AppointmentReader<br/>DoctorScheduleProvider «interfaces»}}
    eloq[EloquentDoctorRepository<br/>DbAppointmentReader] -. implementa .-> port
    mem[InMemoryDoctorRepository<br/>pruebas] -. implementa .-> port
    sched[ConfigScheduleProvider<br/>luego tabla doctor_schedules] -. implementa .-> port
    app --> audit[AuditLogger<br/>auditoría H8]
  end
  api --> mw
  eloq --> db[(doctor_profiles · doctor_specialties · specialties<br/>appointments solo lectura · local_access_audits)]
  cons[Citas · Admisión] --> app
